1
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:23,920
 Today we are celebrating Sri Dattajayanti. Dattajayanti means the birthday of Lord Dattatreya,

2
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:32,200
 the divine son of Sage Atri and Mother Anasuya, who was born on this auspicious day of Maharkashi

3
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:39,680
 Repurnima. Lord Dattatreya is none other than the human incarnation of Parabrahman. Parabrahman

4
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:49,400
 is the absolute God. We know that Parabrahman does not have any birth. He is unimaginable.

5
00:01:49,400 --> 00:02:03,400
 No soul can think about him or even imagine him. Naturally, it is impossible to pray to him or serve him. That is why Parabrahman incarnates.

6
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:16,400
 In the very beginning, Parabrahman created the first energetic being called Dattah in the upper world. Then he merged into Dattah to become Lord Dattah.

7
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:33,400
 God Dattah, the first incarnation of Parabrahman, is an energetic incarnation in the upper world. God Dattah then further merged into other energetic beings to become some more energetic incarnations.

8
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:54,400
 They are all energetic incarnations of God Dattah as well as of Parabrahman. God Dattah or any of his subsequent energetic incarnations also periodically merged with selected human beings to become human incarnations of God.

9
00:02:54,400 --> 00:03:14,400
 In every human generation, there is at least one human incarnation of God on earth. In the past, God Dattah, the first energetic incarnation, merged with the second son of Atri and Anasuya to become a human incarnation of God on earth.

10
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:27,400
 This human incarnation was called the Dattahatreya. God Dattah is the first energetic incarnation of God. While God Dattahatreya is his human incarnation.

11
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:44,400
 Here I want to share a wonderful miraculous experience. One day as I was walking down the road in Mumbai, I experienced some sages. I saw some sages and angels in the sky with my own eyes.

12
00:03:44,400 --> 00:04:02,400
 They were discussing about our beloved Sadguru, Sri Dattaswami. They were saying to each other, who is this Dattaswami? He carried a black bag on his shoulder and teaching chemistry in the university.

13
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:24,399
 And yet he also gives spiritual discourses and changes the laws of this universe frequently. Who is he? They were unable to know the identity of Swami. However, they were deepening and analyzing the spiritual concepts preached by Swami.

14
00:04:24,399 --> 00:04:36,399
 Finally, they concluded that Dattaswami is none other than God Dattah. They identified him to be a human incarnation of God Dattah.

15
00:04:36,399 --> 00:04:55,399
 The point to note here is that they identified Swami as divinity based on the spiritual knowledge preached by Swami. They did not conclude that Swami is a human incarnation because he has many miracles.

16
00:04:55,399 --> 00:05:17,399
 In fact, angels and sages themselves can do miracles. They concluded that Swami is an incarnation of God Dattah because his spiritual knowledge is extraordinary. They have never heard this kind of extraordinary spiritual knowledge anywhere in this world.

17
00:05:17,399 --> 00:05:39,399
 This is the first time Parapram has revealed such extraordinary spiritual knowledge to mankind. He has revealed it to Sri Dattaswami.

18
00:05:39,399 --> 00:05:56,399
 That is the uniqueness of this incarnation. Sri Dattaswami is the embodiment of highest and most complete spiritual knowledge. The conclusion of the sages and angels was based on that spiritual knowledge of Swami.

19
00:05:56,399 --> 00:06:15,399
 Sri Dattaswami is the contemporary human incarnation of God Dattah on earth. This fact became clear to me from listening to this sages and angels discussing in the sky. It was the most wonderful miracle.

20
00:06:15,399 --> 00:06:36,399
 The unimaginable God incarnating on the earth as human incarnation is His greatest gift to humanity. It is the greatest spiritual opportunity. Unfortunately, this greatest gift also inevitably comes with the biggest problem.

21
00:06:36,399 --> 00:07:01,399
 It is called the Common Media Repulsion. People only see the human medium of the human incarnation. They are human and the Incognitions medium is also human. They obviously cannot see the Parapram Man who is merged into the human medium since Parapram Man is unimaginable.

22
00:07:01,399 --> 00:07:20,399
 So they think that the human incarnation is only a human being. They think that He is not different from them. He seems to eat, drink, talk, walk and behave like them. He also seems to suffer from diseases like them.

23
00:07:20,399 --> 00:07:46,399
 So they think that He is only a human being. Then they notice His greatness. They observe how some devotees treat Him to be God and they get jealousy of Him. This jealousy is the Common Media Repulsion. Due to their jealousy and hatred, they lose the greatest spiritual opportunity.

24
00:07:46,399 --> 00:08:08,399
 All human beings suffer from this Common Media Repulsion which caused them to reject the human incarnation. Not just human beings, even angels suffer from it. Indra, the King of Angels, too failed to recognize the divinity of God, Krishna, due to such repulsion.

25
00:08:08,399 --> 00:08:27,399
 It is a great Maya, a great delusion that takes us away from God. How can we overcome this Maya? The only way to overcome it is to reserve His excellent spiritual knowledge and analyze it.

26
00:08:27,399 --> 00:08:48,399
 The Vedas says that the preacher of who and infinite spiritual knowledge is incarnation of Parapram Man, Sacham Jnanamanandam Brahma. The spiritual knowledge preached by the human incarnation of God is extraordinary, Vijnanam Brahma.

27
00:08:48,399 --> 00:09:08,399
 It is found nowhere else in the creation. The preacher who preaches such extraordinary, true and infinite spiritual knowledge should be concluded to be the genuine human incarnation of God. Our fortune is infinite.

28
00:09:08,399 --> 00:09:31,399
 The ultimate Parapram Man, the embodiment of complete spiritual knowledge has himself come down to earth. He has descended as Sri Vata Swami, a very powerful dhanava tara, the most complete and highest human incarnation of Parapram Man.

29
00:09:31,399 --> 00:09:52,399
