 So he can convert, God Datta can convert himself into Krishna.

224
00:25:38,400 --> 00:25:41,400
 And Krishna can convert into God Datta.

225
00:25:41,400 --> 00:25:42,400
 Now when then?

226
00:25:42,400 --> 00:25:49,400
 But original forms are for God Datta, energetic form.

227
00:25:49,400 --> 00:25:53,400
 And for Krishna, human form.

228
00:25:53,400 --> 00:26:00,400
 So normally there will be in those things only, in those forms only.

229
00:26:00,400 --> 00:26:10,400
 Why he should condense his energy into matter and again he can reconvert into energy?

230
00:26:10,400 --> 00:26:14,400
 That is bad administration.

231
00:26:14,400 --> 00:26:22,400
 Then in one stage, even in energetic form he can talk with me.

232
00:26:22,400 --> 00:26:29,400
 Why should he convert into matter and after talking with me he converts back into energy?

233
00:26:29,400 --> 00:26:32,400
 That is bad administration.

234
00:26:32,400 --> 00:26:36,400
 He is an administrator, excellent administrator.

235
00:26:36,400 --> 00:26:42,400
 He will not do unnecessary things.

236
00:26:42,400 --> 00:26:45,400
 You answered kind of my other question also Swahib.

237
00:26:45,400 --> 00:26:50,400
 Why I ask this is, when you prayed to Sathya Sai Baba, he appeared as a human incarnation.

238
00:26:50,400 --> 00:26:51,400
 Yes.

239
00:26:51,400 --> 00:26:52,400
 Because he came as a human incarnation.

240
00:26:52,400 --> 00:26:54,400
 He is in human form.

241
00:26:54,400 --> 00:26:56,400
 He can appear as human form.

242
00:26:56,400 --> 00:26:58,400
 Why should he appear as energy form?

243
00:26:58,400 --> 00:27:00,400
 I was comparing these two events.

244
00:27:00,400 --> 00:27:04,400
 There Sathya Sai is in human form.

245
00:27:04,400 --> 00:27:06,400
 God Datta is in energetic form.

246
00:27:06,400 --> 00:27:10,400
 That is their natural forms.

247
00:27:10,400 --> 00:27:17,400
 By miraculous power they can appear as matter, forms of matter also.

248
00:27:17,400 --> 00:27:20,400
 Understood Swahib.

249
00:27:24,400 --> 00:27:27,400
 So questions are very less in numbers.

250
00:27:27,400 --> 00:27:32,400
 I should have slept up to four or five.

251
00:27:32,400 --> 00:27:42,400
 Actually Datta Jayanti begins from now, from this minute.

252
00:27:42,400 --> 00:27:49,400
 Not eating meals, taking food items and then sleeping.

253
00:27:49,400 --> 00:27:52,400
 That is not Datta Jayanti.

254
00:27:52,400 --> 00:27:56,400
 Datta is Guru Datta, knowledge.

255
00:27:56,400 --> 00:28:06,400
 In fact, in order not to have drowsiness and to keep the brain alert,

256
00:28:06,400 --> 00:28:12,400
 all of us should have fasted today and did the satsang.

257
00:28:12,400 --> 00:28:16,400
 The brain will be very active.

258
00:28:16,400 --> 00:28:24,400
 On all other festivals, full eating and sleeping and in the night seeing a cinema.

259
00:28:24,400 --> 00:28:30,400
 So that okay chalta hai.

260
00:28:30,400 --> 00:28:35,400
 But for Guru Datta, he is the embodiment of knowledge.

261
00:28:35,400 --> 00:28:40,400
 When knowledge discussion takes place, he is very much pleased.

262
00:28:40,400 --> 00:28:45,400
 Gnana igne na tena aham istasyaam iti me matihi.

263
00:28:45,400 --> 00:28:51,400
 I like the spiritual debate, spiritual discussion.

264
00:28:51,400 --> 00:28:56,400
 He doesn't like the vadaayi, purnaam and all these things.

265
00:28:56,400 --> 00:29:06,400
 So every festival in fact we should turn as Datta festival.

266
00:29:06,400 --> 00:29:16,400
 You see, in Krishna's tummy, you fast and then engage in Bhagavatam.

267
00:29:16,400 --> 00:29:19,400
 Sriramana Umi, you fast.

268
00:29:19,400 --> 00:29:25,400
 Ancient generation, elders they used to fast on festivals.

269
00:29:25,400 --> 00:29:29,400
 Sriramana Umi, you fast.

270
00:29:29,400 --> 00:29:39,400
 So while fasting, the heavy food, the drowsiness will leave, will not be there.

271
00:29:39,400 --> 00:29:42,400
 Mind will be very alert.

272
00:29:42,400 --> 00:29:52,400
 Then you can follow their life histories, their life, divine life and get inspiration.

273
00:29:52,400 --> 00:29:54,400
 By that the God is pleased.

